KAWAD SWAD SALES MANAGEMENT SYSTEM - DEVELOPMENT TEMPLATE,
Purpose,Starter workbook to upload to Google Drive and open in Google Sheets.
Important,Use as a DEVELOPMENT copy first. Do not connect it to the live ERP spreadsheet until tested.
How to use,"Upload this .xlsx to Google Drive, open with Google Sheets, then optionally use File > Save as Google Sheets."
Data rule,Keep headers and tab names unchanged. Use unique IDs; do not rely on row numbers.
Security,This workbook does not enforce login permissions. The web app backend must enforce roles.
Roles,OWNER_ADMIN = full access; PA = Mahi; FIELD_SALESMAN = field salesman.
Payments,Current workflow requires full payment. No credit or partial payment.
Pricing,Record the actual selling price on each SaleItems line. Product master does not set a fixed selling price.
Retail rule,"Retail Sale is packet-based only: 200 g, 500 g, or 1000 g papad packs. No loose-weight retail sale."
Stock rule,Salesman stock is separate from company stock. Do not alter company stock through this template.
Audit rule,Issued bills must not be silently overwritten. Corrections/cancellations need authorisation and audit records.
GST note,"GST registration and tax setup are unconfirmed. Do not assume GSTIN, tax rate, HSN, or Tax Invoice status."
Next step,"Review Products and Settings, test sample transactions, then build code against the validated structure."
Product range update,Moong Khata Meetha Papad has been removed from this development product master. Do not add it back unless explicitly approved.
SKU convention,"Product SKUs use abbreviated product codes, for example KS-MMP-200 for Moong Master Papad 200 g. Review all proposed abbreviations before production use."